diacritics.timsen is the small table of Tim Sen (https://github.com/ngosen/timsen): counts of
syllables and of two- and three-syllable sequences, written by research.table. It holds no running
text from the corpora it was counted in:

- Vietnamese Wikipedia (wikimedia/wikipedia 20231101.vi), CC BY-SA 4.0,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
- FineWeb-2 vie_Latn (https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-2), made available by
  Hugging Face under the Open Data Commons Attribution License (ODC-By) v1.0,
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/, plus the Common Crawl terms of use
- OpenSubtitles 2018, monolingual Vietnamese, from OPUS (https://opus.nlpl.eu), subtitles from
  http://www.opensubtitles.org/. P. Lison and J. Tiedemann, 2016, "OpenSubtitles2016: Extracting
  Large Parallel Corpora from Movie and TV Subtitles", LREC 2016. OPUS releases it without a
  licence; only counts are shipped.

The counts are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0 AND ODC-By-1.0
